@startuml
skin rose
skinparam ActivityFontSize 15
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
start
:Command copies the contact data
as previousState and changes it;
:Command calls
Model#commitAddressBook(previousState, message);

'Since the beta syntax does not support placing the condition outside the
'diamond we place it as the true branch instead.

if () then ([previousState has the same
contacts as the current data])
    :Ignore the commit;
else ([else])
    if () then ([previousState differs
from currentState])
        :Clear undoStates,
        which are stale;
    else ([else])
    endif
    :Push a copy of previousState
    with message onto undoStates;
    :Clear redoStates;
    :Set currentState to a copy
    of the current data;
endif
stop
@enduml
